<title>INDIA: Indian July vehicle production rises.</title>
<headline>Indian July vehicle production rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian production of vehicles in July 1996, rose compared to same month in the previous year, the Association of Indian Automobile Manufacturers (AIAM) said in a monthly statement on Monday.</p>
<p>    AUTOMOBILE PRODUCTION &amp; SALES	  (number of units)</p>
<p>  Category			PRODUCTION</p>
<p>		   Jul 96   Jul 95  Apr96-Jul 96 Apr95-Jul 95</p>
<p>   TRUCKS	25,669   21,647    93,549	 76,995</p>
<p>   CARS	  34,296   29,483   127,298	102,936</p>
<p>   2-WHEELERS 277,304  215,125   999,783	813,376</p>
<p>					 SALES</p>
<p>		   Jul 96   Jul 95  Apr96-Jul 96 Apr95-Jul 95</p>
<p>   TRUCKS	24,689   21,912    88,392	 72,991</p>
<p>   CARS	  35,139   30,849   125,339	100,889</p>
<p>   2-WHEELERS 267,100  213,488   970,949	805,056</p>
<p>Source: Association of Indian Automobile Manufacturers</p>
<p>--New Delhi Newsroom +91-11-301-2024</p>
</text>
